Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:11.22,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Summer break felt much \Nshorter than it really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:12.57,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's now a new term.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:14.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.04,Main,GuyE7-1,0,0,0,,Hey, could you hold up that end?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:21.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're already busy getting ready \Nfor our cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.31,Main,GirlE7-1,0,0,0,,You're so good with your hands, Izumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:30.21,Main,GirlE7-2,0,0,0,,Your feminine appeal is off the charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:32.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:41.72,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Whew... They can't really expect \Nus to do all this today, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:44.97,Main,GirlE7-1,0,0,0,,What? I think we can finish it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:46.24,Main,GirlE7-2,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:50.52,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,High school girls these \Ndays are so carefree...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're a high school girl, too, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.11,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm in the costuming group,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:01:00.62,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(605,233)\fnComic Sans MS\fay.02\fs14\shad0\3c&HFDFFFF&\c&H686E73&}Balloons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:01:00.62,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fay.04\fs14\shad0\3c&HFDFFFF&\c&H686E73&\pos(602,302)}Ornaments
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:01:00.62,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fry50\frz10\fs14\shad0\3c&HFDFFFF&\c&H686E73&\pos(247,258)}Costumes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but Shikimori-san's on decor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:00.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,so we're working separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:04.62,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(168.333,277.333)}Izumi Filter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.13,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hey, you just stabbed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.33,Main,GuyE7-2,0,0,0,,We need cactus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:13.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then it'd be a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:15.60,Main,GuyE7-3,0,0,0,,There's no cactus growing around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:19.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Looks like they're having fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.07,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,We were in the same group last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:25.63,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,so I got to talk with her a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:27.89,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but we didn't get that chance this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:29.73,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're so lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:32.15,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Izumi. Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:35.51,Main,GirlE7-1,0,0,0,,Izumi-kun, do you know how to sew this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:40.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You insert the needle from the back \Nand push it through to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.54,Main,GirlE7-1,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:42.97,Main,GirlE7-2,0,0,0,,He's done it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:45.55,Main,GirlE7-3,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it! You're so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.84,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Me?! {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one you're mad at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.22,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What did I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:04.32,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Life sure is rough for her, huh?
