Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:40.73,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today's the first day of our \Nthree-day cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:45.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm nervous since our class's exhibit \Nis more demanding than last year's,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.24,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:51.29,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,Yuu, are you okay on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:53.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:57.25,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\bord1\3c&H626F8C&\pos(305,18)}Cultural Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:55.20,Main,GuyE7-4,0,0,0,,Heya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:56.70,Main,GuyE7-5,0,0,0,,C'mon, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:04:00.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fs14\fnArial\shad0\bord1\3c&H626F8C&\pos(169,212)}Cultural Festival
