Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:02.92,Main,Student Council Guy,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:05.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.14,Main,Student Council Girl,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Forty-four...
