Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:12.14,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs36\frx20\frz20\shad0\bord0\c&HA1798E&\pos(538,205)}DEATH
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What an unlucky number.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:16.39,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nothing new for me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.90,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're doing it again this year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:23.39,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This game is really fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:26.14,Main,Student Council Guy,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:29.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Listen up, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We're gonna earn the highest \Nprofit in the school
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.93,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,and win the prize that every \Nsingle student is hungry for:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:39.52,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,the free after-party tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:41.66,Main,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:45.70,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi, you and that costume \Nare tragically mismatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.67,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Well, no one's even gonna know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:52.18,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It looks hot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I don't look weird, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:02.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't think it's too audacious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:05.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You look super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:08.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really? You look great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:12.71,Main,Giraffe Girl,0,0,0,,You two! Quit staring at each \Nother and get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:18.72,Italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,The 97th Hachiou Festival will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:23.21,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fry20\frx20\shad0\fnArial\c&H385360&\fs18\3c&HA1E8FA&\b1\move(106,193,125,193)}Tiger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:23.21,Main,GuyE7-6,0,0,0,,Welcome! How many in your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:26.03,Main,GuyE7-7,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:30.06,Main,GirlE7-4,0,0,0,,Over here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:37.23,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz5\pos(369,128)\fs18\b1\fnArial\c&H6462E5&\3c&HF9F9F5&\4c&H67A3AB&\bord3}A{\c&H53B3EC&}ni{\c&H64D36C&}ma{\c&HA66EE2&}l {\c&HCB9C5B&}Café
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:35.64,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Class 2-4's running an animal café!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.23,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Come on down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.73,Main,CustomerC,0,0,0,,Hey, look. Isn't that bunny adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.26,Main,Customers,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:43.37,Main,CustomerB,0,0,0,,Wow, that's really elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.18,Main,CustomerC,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:49.36,Main,Customer D,0,0,0,,Two chocolate ice creams, \None matcha ice cream,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.61,Main,Customer D,0,0,0,,an orange juice, a lemon squash, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.70,Main,CustomerE,0,0,0,,Can I get a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.10,Main,CustomerF,0,0,0,,What kind of animal are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:05:59.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.87,Main,CustomerG,0,0,0,,What's this "giraffe parfait" like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:04.58,Main,CustomerH,0,0,0,,Excuse me! I still haven't gotten my order!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.84,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're way too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.09,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I have to do the best I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.72,Main,Giraffe Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:17.00,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What?! What did I step on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I don't have time to \Nwatch where I'm walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:20.83,Main,Giraffe Girl,0,0,0,,Izumi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.60,Main,Chick Guy,0,0,0,,There it is! Just like always!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.35,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.61,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I have to save the ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:37.59,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We're all here.\N Don't rush around by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:39.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:42.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:46.37,Main,CustomerE,0,0,0,,The rabbit turned the lion into a kitty-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:51.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We really had a lot of customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There'll probably be even more tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:55.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:59.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's walk around together \Ntomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure. I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:06.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You'll be working in the \Nlibrary all morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:08.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What'll you be doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:09.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:13.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The library's just open as a rest area,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:14.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,so I won't be doing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:18.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I drew the three-hour shift \Non the second day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:20.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,the one nobody really wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:26.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're on duty at the animal \Ncafé all morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:26.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:33.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:37.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I just... feel kinda bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Everyone else will be working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:46.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll work hard enough for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:55.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll work my hardest at my job, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:59.44,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Just be careful not to knock \Nany bookshelves over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:03.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll work so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.47,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(65,125)\b1\fs14\fnArial\c&H888893&\shad0\3c&HF9FDFD&}Soba\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:11.47,Main,GuyE7-8,0,0,0,,Where do you wanna start today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,336)\frz190\b1\fs14\fnArial\c&H88E7EA&\shad0\3c&HA587E5&}Fortunes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz193\b1\fs12\fnArial\c&HEAE9F4&\shad0\3c&HA587E5&\pos(554,261)}Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz193\b1\fs12\fnArial\c&HEAE9F4&\shad0\3c&HA587E5&\pos(485,276)}Palm Reading
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(224,254)\frz15\fnArial\fs20\c&H93EBE9&\3c&HA996E9&\4c&HA996E9&}Love
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz3\b1\fnArial\fs20\c&H84D2D8&\3c&HF5F0FD&\4c&HF5F0FD&\pos(317,327)}Fortunes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&H4F537B&\shad0\3c&H96EBED&\pos(320,80)}Accurate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(384,157)\shad0\c&H535C63&\3c&HF1FDFC&\b1}Determine\NYour\NDestiny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\an8\pos(174,10)\3c&HFBFAF7&\4c&HFBFAF7&\c&H61676F&}Frighteningly {\c&H4FD8D4&}accurate! \N{\c&H757DC5&}200 {\c&H61676F&}yen per reading
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\pos(48,60)\3c&H975AAA&\shad0}Fortunes Read
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:14.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b1\3c&H686DF1&\shad0\pos(107,84)\c&HF2F0FF&}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:21.80,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, there's supposed \Nto be one other person on library duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:28.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\fnArial\fay-.1\fs10\shad0\pos(262,125)\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:28.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\fnArial\fry30\fs12\fay-.2\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\pos(287,268)}Rest Area
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:28.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\fnArial\fry-70\fay.2\fs12\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\pos(594,261)}Cultural Festival Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:25.60,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I hope it's someone in my grade, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:31.38,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It'd be a little awkward to spend three \Nhours with someone I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:31.69,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)\fnArial\fay-.1\b1\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\pos(289,53)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:31.69,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)\fnArial\fay.18\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H615DC2&\3c&HF8FDFF&\pos(378,199)}Notice from the Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.71,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I wondered who would be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.34,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Hi, Izumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:53.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're on the library \Ncommittee again this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:57.48,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I'm glad the other person \Non duty is someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.93,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Mind helping me put these books away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:01.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:09.53,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I got to know Kamiya-san through \Nthe library committee last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:13.53,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's the volleyball team's ace. She's tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's cool and composed, \Npretty, and kind to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.49,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's someone loved and admired \Nby boys and girls alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:23.37,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,141)\bord0\shad0\c&H323861&\fnComic Sans MS\b1}Class 1-4 \NClass 2-4
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:23.37,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H323861&\fnComic Sans MS\b1\pos(230,253)}Class 1-3 \NClass 2-1
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.19,0:09:23.37,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Last year, she was in the class next to mine,\N so we had library duty together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:29.63,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H464654&\3c&HF6FCF8&\pos(125,287)}Book Borrowing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:26.25,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I was really nervous at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:29.26,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but Kamiya-san was friendly \Nand talked to me openly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:35.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's unusual for you to \Ndraw the short straw like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:37.55,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What's your class doing for the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:48.75,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,A café.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:51.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really? Same as my class, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They must really be struggling \Nwithout you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.45,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.62,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,People cried trying to stop \Nme from leaving yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I figured!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:06.46,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\fnArial\fs16\c&H3D2D57&\3c&HE994D9&\shad0\move(505,200,529,200)}Café
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:04.34,Flashback,GirlE7-5,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:06.45,Flashback,GirlE7-6,0,0,0,,Have mercy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:11.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're always surrounded by people, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:15.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You were crazy popular with the younger \Nstudents at the ball sports tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.86,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Things are always chaotic \Nin class and at my club.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.09,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,That's why I like the \Noccasional quiet moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:27.26,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Like... right now, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:34.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,980)\move(117,77,117,133)\c&H4B4B4D&\fnArial\3c&HFCFEFE&\shad0\fs18)}Cultural Festival Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:34.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,980)\c&H4B4B4D&\fnArial\3c&HFCFEFE&\shad0\fs12)\move(160,254,160,310)}The library is open\N as a rest area \N{\c&H7E8CD6&}-Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.11,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFBFEFD&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(316.666,273.333)}A Year and a Half Earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.70,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,U-Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.64,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Would you like to borrow a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:49.01,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,No, I'm here from the library committee! \NI'm Izumi from Class 1-4!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:53.47,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Oh. Nice to meet you. I'm Kamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:55.46,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nice to mee— Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.51,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Izumi-kun, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:02.77,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so nervous. \NWe're in the same grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.69,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:07.48,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's my first time on library duty,\N so I'm kinda nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:08.99,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.94,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,If you click this tab,\Nit'll sort everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:17.46,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,This is where you input the names and \Ndates of everyone who borrowed books.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.36,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.23,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're good at explaining things, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:22.30,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:28.86,Flashback,GirlE7-7,0,0,0,,We're starting with a run today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.49,0:11:33.12,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hi, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.30,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Hey, Izumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:37.62,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're here earlier than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:38.73,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:42.82,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I got the work I was asked to do for \Nthe student council done yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:45.88,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,My classmates asked me to \Njoin them on a shopping run,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.36,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,but I apologized and turned them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:49.76,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.68,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're really nice, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.50,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:05.98,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,No one's ever told me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:13.00,Main,Fortuneteller,0,0,0,,Heaven, lake, flame, thunder, \Nwind, water, mountain, earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.50,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay-.1\b1\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\pos(289,53)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.50,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay.18\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H615DC2&\3c&HF8FDFF&\pos(378,199)}Notice from the Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:17.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:22.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Then you can just relax\Nand leave the work to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:33.01,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It's just... you seem different somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:34.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:37.02,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.41,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.14,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It must be because you got a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:47.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-You know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:49.21,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Nekozaki told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:51.15,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,We're in the volleyball club together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.95,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Her name's Shikimori-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:57.96,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You two are in the same class \Nagain this year? What luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.92,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Anyway, she's really pretty and \N an amazing person, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:05.10,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,She was the star of the ball \Nsports tournament, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.60,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You must be pretty proud, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:11.80,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san's a lot more\N talkative than usual today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.98,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,So, what was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:15.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.18,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I mean... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:22.76,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,How did you get together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:28.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wh-Wh-Wh-Why do you ask that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.39,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I don't get to talk relationships \Nvery often, so I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:33.66,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Nothing more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.87,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,So? What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're super interested in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.68,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I swear it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:41.80,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I swear there's no deeper meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.43,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I-I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:48.84,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,interested in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:51.58,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,How long have you been dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.09,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Which one of you asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh... K-Kamiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.91,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why is she pressing me about Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.17,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Could it be that Kamiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.77,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,likes Shikimori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:09.45,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz20\fs18\b1\fnArial\c&H49BCF5&\3c&H016F9F&\4c&H67A3AB&\bord1\shad0\i1\move(431,35,490,35)}A{\c&H1232C8&}ni{\c&H64D36C&}ma{\c&H3030E2&}l {\c&HC0C082&}Café
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.45,Main,GirlE7-8,0,0,0,,Anyone in our class have matching numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:17.71,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HECF7FB&\frx-40\an8\fnArial\fs18\c&H884DD6&\4c&HA1FDF8&\move(255,-10,255,36)}Couple {\c&HDCE95E&}Numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:12.98,Main,GirlE7-9,0,0,0,,Hmm... Doesn't look like \Nthere are any pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.67,Main,GirlE7-10,0,0,0,,Well, there are about 600 students here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.72,Main,GuyE7-9,0,0,0,,Let's go check out the other classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.13,Main,GuyE7-10,0,0,0,,I'm totally gonna find mine this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.63,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\c&HF84752&\shad0\bord0\pos(173,84)}Inu\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NIzumi\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NUeda
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.38,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\c&HD85DEE&\shad0\pos(164,7)\bord4\3c&HE8F9FD&}Satou\N\N\N\N\N\NShikimori\N\N\N\N\N\N\NTakeda\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\c&HF84752&}Tanachuu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:29.13,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, we gotta go get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:32.31,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Glaring at the numbers isn't \Ngonna change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.02,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You can't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.90,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,This "Couple Numbers" game
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:41.15,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,jinxes the two people with the same \Nnumber to be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:45.16,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It was kind of a low-key hit last year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.47,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.71,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Couple Numbers is a famous \Nevent at our school,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.71,0:14:53.13,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,sponsored by the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:55.17,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:15:03.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\shad0\pos(273,37)\c&H3A5160&\3c&HE8FAFB&}Couple Numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:59.91,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Numbers for all 600 students in the school \Nare posted outside their classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:03.42,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,The goal is to find the one student \Nwhose number matches yours
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:07.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,and take a picture together to \Ncomplete this high-difficulty quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:09.03,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What "quest"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:15.17,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Well, last year, that was how Shikimori...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:27.82,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HECF7FB&an8\b1\fnArial\fs18\c&H884DD6&\4c&HA1FDF8&\pos(238,24)}Couple {\c&HDCE95E&}Numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:22.90,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,So it probably bugs her that some rando \Nmight get to take a picture with Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:24.53,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Some rando?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:30.20,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,A-About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:36.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I will find whoever has Izumi-kun's number...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,and trade with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:43.58,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay-.1\fs10\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\move(199,125,262,125)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:43.58,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fry30\fs12\fay-.2\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HF7F7F3&\move(224,268,287,268)}Rest Area
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:43.58,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{)\fnArial\fry-70\fay.2\fs12\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HF7F7F3&\move(531,261,594,261)}Cultural Festival Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:41.08,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, th-that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.59,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,At least let the poor rando live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:44.84,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay-.1\b1\shad0\c&H5D6060&\3c&HDEE0DC&\pos(289,53)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:44.84,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fay.18\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H615DC2&\3c&HF8FDFF&\pos(378,199)}Notice from the Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:44.84,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.71,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,When did you and Shikimori-san start dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:51.96,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Okay, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:54.75,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,K-Kamiya-san is always so cool and calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.72,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but she's so interested in Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.10,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Go on, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:03.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, we ended up walking around together \Nat last year's cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.36,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\3c&HECF7FB&\b1\frz5\an8\fnArial\fs\c&H884DD6&\4c&HA1FDF8&\pos(187,49)}Couple {\c&HDCE95E&}Numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:07.35,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?! This is amazing, Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.83,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You and I have the same number!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:11.83,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.86,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I wonder how often this happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:18.13,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,U-Um, so, I-Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:19.87,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Would you take a pic...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:25.08,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is the thing where you become \Na couple after taking a picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:23.16,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}A pic... p-picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:28.21,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've never won a raffle before in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.84,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is a miracle like this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.84,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,M-Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:35.27,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,since I was thinking of asking \NShikimori-san out today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:38.09,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}A p-pic... picture... w-with...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:38.10,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,is God giving me a push?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:40.87,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,For now, do you want to walk around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:41.98,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:44.85,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:53.38,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,295)\b1\fs14\fnArial\c&HEAF1F5&\shad0\3c&H4943C0&}Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:51.62,Flashback,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Too bad! Your consolation \Nprize is a balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.14,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Shikimori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:16:59.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\move(449.333,112.333,438.333,112.333)}In the Clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.37,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\move(174.333,42.333,186.333,42.333)}In the Clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:10.90,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,30)\b1\fs10\fnArial\c&HAF6AEE&\shad0\3c&HADEFF6&}Couple Numbers \NPhoto Booth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.03,0:17:07.32,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're taking Couple Numbers photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:10.51,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's in a pretty conspicuous place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:13.56,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,W-We'd take a photo in \Nthe middle of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:15.89,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:19.86,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-shan, would you please \Ntake a picture with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:20.47,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:23.61,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! I was planning to \Ndo that from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:27.87,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,D-Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:29.11,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.21,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:33.52,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm sure it was in my pocket... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.71,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:36.89,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:39.02,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I think I lost it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:41.73,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.61,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I thought something seemed weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:47.55,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I knew this was way too lucky for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.85,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It was just to get my hopes up\N and then let them drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.58,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san's fed up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.00,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:18:04.04,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Maybe God's warning me not to ask her out \Nbecause I'd just cause trouble for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:07.02,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why do I always...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:10.86,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.19,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:14.68,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's look for your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:18.69,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,We'll never find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:21.16,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:23.66,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm positive! That's how it always is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:25.67,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then let's change that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:30.67,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.28,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I might not be able to find it by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.42,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,so would you help me look for it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:39.01,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.35,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:43.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFBFEFD&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(320.666,273.333)}Two Hours Later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:43.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\c&HEA9292&\3c&HF5D3F4&\4c&HF5D3F4&\pos(241,119)\b1}Class Play \N{\c&H9CBC8D&}"Those Who Gather\N in the Afternoon" \N {\c&H2A1DB4&\fs12}In the Gym
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:52.15,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\fnArial\fs16\frz8\c&H8867E0&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HB4FDF4&\pos(244,221)}Couple
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.44,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I lost my number!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:49.52,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,But our numbers match!\N You have to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.17,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFBFEFD&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(316.666,273.333)}They Didn't Find It
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:58.65,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\fay-.2\frz27\pos(88,114)\c&HA640E3&\3c&H97F4FA&\4c&HC9C6FE&}Couple Numbers\N Photo Booth
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:58.67,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,The rules state that you have to take \Nthe picture holding your numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.76,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.78,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Guess not...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.56,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please, we beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:03.43,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.52,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, we just can't—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.54,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then let's change that today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.29,Flashback,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\fay-.35\c&HA640E3&\3c&H97F4FA&\4c&HC9C6FE&\pos(200,48)}Couple Numbers\N Photo Booth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.29,Flashback,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&HA640E3&\3c&H97F4FA&\4c&HC9C6FE&\pos(511,221)}Couple Numbers\N Photo Booth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:11.96,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:13.28,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Impossible or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:18.26,Flashback_Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nothing feels worse than \Nnot doing anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:23.11,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,I desperately want my \Npicture taken with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:30.94,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&H7D42DC&\3c&HFEFFFE&\4c&HC9C6FE&\shad0\pos(443,40)}Couple Numbers {\c&H5B5A60&}Photo Booth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:33.93,Flashback,Booth Girl,0,0,0,,President, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:42.45,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,Hold this and stand over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.45,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:49.01,Flashback,Booth Girl,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:50.69,Flashback,Booth Girl,0,0,0,,We'll take your picture over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.59,Flashback,Booth Girl,0,0,0,,I can't believe the committee \Npresident allowed this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:56.70,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Um... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:59.13,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.40,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.71,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:04.79,Flashback,Booth Guy,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:11.23,Flashback,Booth Girl,0,0,0,,Okay, smile! He's taking it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:19.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I felt pathetic, but since she gave me\N that push, we got our photo taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And after that, behind the gym...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:10.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-One thing led to another, \Nand I asked her out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:14.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry to ramble like that \Nwhen you didn't even ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:17.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.79,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,That's the best tale of youth I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:22.68,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What an elegant reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.89,0:21:26.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whew... I talked about myself way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.19,Main,Kamiya-san,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:29.55,Main,Kamiya-san,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There's no number 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:40.68,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,There are three grades with over \Nfifteen classes between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.80,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,And there's not much time left. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:48.44,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It has to be someone in another class...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:51.97,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I wonder what the person \Nwho has it is like...
